          "type": "fast",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`PreReviewGateConfigLoaderPort::load` performs filesystem-backed configuration loading, and its `FsPreReviewGateConfigLoader` adapter confirms that responsibility, but both are declared synchronous without documenting the deliberate sync-I/O choice. This leaves the port's execution color underspecified and can force an adapter/API redesign when integrated with the review-local path.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 205,
              "category": "sync/async color mismatch"
            }
          ],
          "hash": "rvw1:sha256:62c3516bb35858155e2a63dc824204dddf3c31896602db10de1cfda1c60e1c84",
          "at": "2026-07-31T12:47:24Z"
        },
        {
          "type": "fast",
          "verdict": "zero_findings",
          "findings": [],
          "hash": "rvw1:sha256:fcaa6e387c06708552c971c89edef6c2334913f3d83b3f45a6d3df76a2ae0caf",
          "at": "2026-07-31T12:56:05Z"
        },
        {
          "type": "final",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`usecase::PreReviewGateMatrix::gates_for` returns the construction-wide `PreReviewGateMatrixError`. After `try_new` has produced a total, duplicate-free matrix, `DuplicateScope` and `DuplicateGate` cannot occur during lookup, yet the method documents no producible subset. Use an infallible lookup for resolved scopes or a lookup-specific error type.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 34,
              "category": "API shape / per-method error imprecision"
            }
          ],
          "hash": "rvw1:sha256:fcaa6e387c06708552c971c89edef6c2334913f3d83b3f45a6d3df76a2ae0caf",
          "at": "2026-07-31T13:01:56Z"
        },
        {
          "type": "fast",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`PreReviewGateMatrix::gates_for` now returns `PreReviewGateLookupError`, whose `UnknownScope` variant represents a possible lookup failure, but `PreReviewGateDispatchService::dispatch` still returns `PreReviewGateDispatchError`, which has no lookup-error variant or conversion. The dispatcher therefore has no declared error path for a command whose scope is absent from the validated matrix; add that propagation or make the resolved-scope invariant explicit in the API.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 290,
              "category": "API shape / per-method error imprecision"
            }
