        {
          "type": "final",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`IN-01`/`AC-01` and the `OS-03` preservation mapping are assigned to T001/T002, but those tasks only add use-case types and a filesystem loader. No task targets the configuration schema or data that declares the scope × gate matrix, so the plan can complete without creating the required declarative policy. Add an executable configuration-artifact task and map these anchors to it.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/task-coverage.json",
              "line": 4,
              "category": "task-coverage gap"
            },
            {
              "message": "`AC-01` through `AC-05` are mapped only to T001–T005, but none of those task descriptions contains a validation or test operation. The test-line estimates in `batch-plan.json` do not define executable validation work. Add explicit validation-bearing steps or dedicated validation tasks for every AC.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/task-coverage.json",
              "line": 21,
              "category": "task-coverage gap"
            },
            {
              "message": "The `plan` omits `summary`, leaving GO-01 and GO-02 without goal-to-task traceability. Goals cannot be represented in `task-coverage.json` by design; add concise anchor-only mappings in `plan.summary`.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/impl-plan.json",
              "line": 39,
              "category": "task-coverage gap"
            },
            {
              "message": "T002 is attributed to `infrastructure/FsPreReviewGateConfigLoader`, whose catalogue entry declares `module_path: pre_review_gate_config`, while T002 targets `review_v2/pre_review_gate_config_loader.rs` and registration under `review_v2`. Completing T002 as written would not implement the attributed entry at its contracted module path. Align the task target with the catalogue or re-enter type design.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/task-contract.json",
              "line": 14,
              "category": "task-contract attribution mismatch"
            },
            {
              "message": "S1's text, `宣言的な matrix と、その typed loading / validation 境界を先に完成させる。`, restates the declarative-matrix and validation contract from GO-01/IN-01/AC-01 instead of citing it. Rewrite the section as target + operation + anchor cites, as required by `.harness/policies/no-upstream-restatement.md`.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/impl-plan.json",
              "line": 45,
              "category": "upstream restatement"
            },
            {
              "message": "T003 bundles independently verifiable behavior units while still `todo`: (1) matrix/scope resolution and the non-applicable planning-scope path (IN-02, IN-04, AC-02, AC-04), and (2) execution of the existing task-contract gate for implementation scopes without changing its semantics (IN-03, OS-01, CN-03, AC-03). Split these into dependent tasks before implementation.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/impl-plan.json",
              "line": 19,
              "category": "pre-implementation split proposal"
            },
            {
              "message": "T005's stated operation is already satisfied: the current `track-local-review` script already invokes `bin/sotp review local`. The required change is removal of its scope-blind pre-review dependencies, but the task never names that operation, forcing the executor to invent the change boundary. State the exact dependency removal or wrapper edit.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/scope-conditional-pre-review-gates-2026-07-31/impl-plan.json",
              "line": 33,
              "category": "task description non-executable"
            }
          ],
